WEBVTT

00:07.667 --> 00:08.967
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.967 --> 00:10.767
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.767 --> 00:12.233
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.233 --> 00:14.400
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.400 --> 00:17.233
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.233 --> 00:19.333
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.333 --> 00:21.333
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.333 --> 00:23.233
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.233 --> 00:24.867
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.867 --> 00:27.367
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.367 --> 00:29.200
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.200 --> 00:31.300
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.300 --> 00:33.333
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.333 --> 00:35.200
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.200 --> 00:37.533
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.533 --> 00:39.467
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.467 --> 00:40.800
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.800 --> 00:42.667
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.667 --> 00:45.400
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.400 --> 00:47.433
*
*
*
*

00:47.433 --> 00:48.567
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.600 --> 00:54.600
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

00:54.600 --> 01:01.200
*
*
*
*

01:01.200 --> 01:03.500
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

01:03.500 --> 01:08.067
I wish to register
a complaint.
我想注册
投诉。

01:08.067 --> 01:09.733
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

01:09.733 --> 01:10.933
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

01:10.933 --> 01:12.867
An urchin!
一个顽童！

01:12.867 --> 01:14.467
- Yuck!
- 恶心！

01:14.467 --> 01:17.433
- Hey lady, take your infested
patty with you.
- 嘿女士，带走你的感染者
帕蒂和你在一起。

01:17.433 --> 01:19.767
Okay, no need to panic,
Squidward,
好的，不用惊慌，
章鱼哥，

01:19.767 --> 01:21.667
It's just a puny urchin.
这只是一个微不足道的顽童而已。

01:21.667 --> 01:24.400
Everything's gonna be fine
as long as you...
一切都会好起来的
只要你...

01:24.400 --> 01:26.933
smash it! Smash it!
Smash it!
粉碎它！粉碎它！
粉碎它！

01:26.933 --> 01:29.400
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:29.400 --> 01:30.867
Phew.
唷。

01:30.867 --> 01:33.067
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:36.567 --> 01:38.400
[moaning]
[呻吟]

01:38.400 --> 01:41.067
- [gasps]
Squidward, I'm surprised at you.
- [喘气]
章鱼哥，你让我很惊讶。

01:41.067 --> 01:42.767
That little urchin
wasn't hurting anyone.
那个小顽童
没有伤害任何人。

01:42.767 --> 01:44.833
He's still one
of Neptune's creatures,
他还是一个人
海王星的生物，

01:44.833 --> 01:46.767
no matter how small he is.
不管他有多小。

01:49.467 --> 01:52.067
This is where the magic happens,
little urchin.
这就是神奇发生的地方
小顽童。

01:52.067 --> 01:53.767
First we turn up the heat,
首先我们把火调大，

01:53.767 --> 01:55.700
but don't make it too hot.
但不要让它太热。

01:55.700 --> 01:58.133
Would you like to see
a menu, monsieur?
你想看吗
菜单吗，先生？

01:58.133 --> 01:59.767
[laughing]
- [growling]
[笑]
- [咆哮]

01:59.767 --> 02:01.267
- Ow!
- 噢！

02:01.267 --> 02:04.167
- [chittering]
- [叽叽喳喳]

02:04.167 --> 02:06.267
- Okay, little guy,
see you later.
- 好吧，小家伙，
稍后见。

02:06.267 --> 02:07.933
Good thing he is
a little guy.
还好他是
一个小家伙。

02:07.933 --> 02:10.067
Ouch.
哎哟。

02:12.533 --> 02:14.800
Ah!
啊!

02:14.800 --> 02:17.800
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

02:17.800 --> 02:18.800
*
*
*
*

02:18.800 --> 02:20.633
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:20.633 --> 02:25.967
* *
**
**
**

02:25.967 --> 02:28.967
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:28.967 --> 02:36.100
*
*
*
*

02:38.067 --> 02:39.400
What the shrimp?
什么虾？

02:39.400 --> 02:41.500
Hey, what's going on here?
嘿，这是怎么回事？

02:41.500 --> 02:43.067
Whoa! That's too hot!
哇！太热了！

02:43.067 --> 02:45.433
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:45.433 --> 02:48.367
Whoa!
哇！

02:49.933 --> 02:51.767
Wow.
哇。

02:51.767 --> 02:53.100
Oops.
[chuckles]
哎呀。
[笑声]

02:53.100 --> 02:56.733
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:56.733 --> 02:59.733
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

02:59.733 --> 03:02.400
* *
**
**
**

03:02.400 --> 03:05.233
I steamed myself tiny.
我把自己蒸得很小。

03:05.233 --> 03:07.800
- Whoo-hoo!
I steamed myself tiny!
- 呼呼！
我把自己蒸小了！

03:07.800 --> 03:10.167
Whoo!
呼！

03:10.167 --> 03:12.100
This place is huge!
这个地方很大！

03:12.100 --> 03:14.167
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:14.167 --> 03:16.533
My spatula's huge.
我的锅铲很大。

03:16.533 --> 03:18.800
And just look at the size
of my grill.
只看尺寸
我的烤架。

03:18.800 --> 03:21.500
It's huge!
太大了！

03:21.500 --> 03:23.633
[bell ringing]
Ow!
[铃声响起]
噢！

03:27.233 --> 03:30.233
[humming]
[soft music]
[嗡嗡声]
[轻音乐]

03:30.233 --> 03:36.367
*
*
*
*

03:37.767 --> 03:38.967
Ow! Ow ow ow ow ow!
噢！呜呜呜呜呜！

03:38.967 --> 03:41.067
Ahh!
啊！

03:41.067 --> 03:43.300
Ahh.
啊。

03:44.333 --> 03:46.100
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:46.100 --> 03:48.133
Come on, flip.
来吧，翻转。

03:48.133 --> 03:49.467
Wha--[grunts]
什——[咕哝]

03:53.333 --> 03:55.067
[groaning]
[呻吟]

03:55.067 --> 03:56.333
[laughing]
[笑]

04:00.333 --> 04:02.067
Uh-oh, the grill blew out.
呃哦，烤架炸了。

04:02.067 --> 04:06.333
Well...[sniffs]
it isn't going to fix itself.
嗯...[鼻子]
它不会自行修复。

04:06.333 --> 04:07.667
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

04:07.667 --> 04:10.067
That's one small step
for SpongeBob,
这只是一小步
对于海绵宝宝来说，

04:10.067 --> 04:14.067
one giant leap for...
Wee!
为……迈出一大步
威！

04:14.067 --> 04:16.800
Whoa.
哇哦。

04:16.800 --> 04:18.667
Bob.
鲍勃.

04:18.667 --> 04:20.300
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:20.300 --> 04:23.433
Whew.
Oh!
呼。
哦！

04:23.433 --> 04:25.633
- [crying]
- What is that?
- [哭泣]
- 那是什么？

04:25.633 --> 04:28.433
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

04:28.433 --> 04:30.767
- Hey,
it's my little urchin friend.
- 嘿，
这是我的小顽童朋友。

04:30.767 --> 04:33.833
Aww, hey, little guy.
Don't cry.
哇哦，嘿，小家伙。
别哭。

04:33.833 --> 04:36.633
Your old pal "Wee-Bob"
will get you out of there.
你的老朋友“Wee-Bob”
会带你离开那里。

04:37.700 --> 04:39.633
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:40.867 --> 04:44.933
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:47.733 --> 04:49.867
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:49.867 --> 04:53.133
Little urchin, you are
free to go. You okay?
小顽童你是
可以自由去。你还好吗？

04:53.133 --> 04:54.400
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

04:54.400 --> 04:56.067
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

04:56.067 --> 04:58.533
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

04:58.533 --> 04:59.400
Yeouch!
哎呀！

04:59.400 --> 05:01.433
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

05:03.733 --> 05:06.333
- [roaring]
- [咆哮]

05:06.333 --> 05:07.500
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:07.500 --> 05:09.800
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

05:09.800 --> 05:10.800
- Wah!
- 哇！

05:10.800 --> 05:12.200
- [blubbering]
- [哭泣]

05:12.200 --> 05:14.100
- Sorry, little guy.
- 对不起，小家伙。

05:14.100 --> 05:15.333
Whoa!
哇！

05:15.333 --> 05:17.900
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

05:17.900 --> 05:19.300
- Whoa! Whoa!
- 哇！哇！

05:20.733 --> 05:23.500
- Follow the pipes to freedom,
little guy.
- 跟随管道走向自由，
小家伙。

05:23.500 --> 05:25.367
I'll never forget you.
我永远不会忘记你。

05:25.367 --> 05:27.700
[grunts]
Really.
[咕哝]
真的。

05:27.700 --> 05:28.733
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:28.733 --> 05:30.133
[bell ringing]
Ow!
[铃声响起]
噢！

05:30.133 --> 05:31.967
What is all that noise?
这些噪音是什么？

05:31.967 --> 05:35.533
[bell ringing]
- One Krabby Patty!
[铃声响起]
- 一份蟹肉饼！

05:35.533 --> 05:38.167
- Coming right up!
- 马上就来！

05:38.167 --> 05:40.867
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

05:40.867 --> 05:43.833
- Urchin!
Smash it! Smash it! Smash it!
- 顽童！
粉碎它！粉碎它！粉碎它！

05:43.833 --> 05:46.167
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

05:46.167 --> 05:49.300
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:50.933 --> 05:52.600
- Ah-ha!
- 啊哈！

05:52.600 --> 05:55.067
You're getting sloppy,
Plankton.
你越来越邋遢了
浮游生物。

05:55.067 --> 05:57.367
Squidward almost squashed you.
章鱼哥差点把你压扁了。

05:57.367 --> 05:58.800
[laughing]
[笑]

05:59.733 --> 06:01.933
Back to the bucket with ya!
和你一起回到水桶吧！

06:01.933 --> 06:05.333
- No! No, Mr. Krabs,
it's me!
- 不！不，蟹老板先生，
是我！

06:05.333 --> 06:07.933
[screaming]
[尖叫]

06:07.933 --> 06:11.600
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:11.600 --> 06:13.767
Ooh. [chuckles]
That tickles.
哦。 [笑声]
那很痒。

06:13.767 --> 06:15.933
- Well, SpongeBob SquarePants.
- 好吧，海绵宝宝。

06:15.933 --> 06:17.867
it looks like you lost
a little weight.
看来你输了
有点重。

06:17.867 --> 06:19.567
- Oh, hi, Karen.
Where's Plankton?
- 哦，嗨，凯伦。
浮游生物在哪里？

06:19.567 --> 06:21.500
- You landed on him.
- 你落在他身上了。

06:21.500 --> 06:24.567
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

06:24.567 --> 06:27.333
- Hi, Plankton.
- [grunts]
- 嗨，浮游生物。
- [咕哝]

06:27.333 --> 06:30.333
"Spongeboob?"
Why are you so small?
“海绵宝宝？”
你怎么这么小？

06:30.333 --> 06:31.767
Is this a trick?
这是一个诡计吗？

06:31.767 --> 06:33.900
- Calm down, he's clean.
I frisked him.
- 冷静点，他很干净。
我搜身了他。

06:33.900 --> 06:36.333
- I didn't mean to get small
like you, Plankton.
- 我并不是故意变小
就像你一样，浮游生物。

06:36.333 --> 06:37.633
It was a freak accident.
这是一次离奇的事故。

06:37.633 --> 06:40.433
- Huh?
Who are you calling a freak?
- 啊？
你说谁是怪胎？

06:40.433 --> 06:44.533
Wait a second.
[chuckles]
等一下。
[笑声]

06:44.533 --> 06:46.500
Hold this.
[grunts]
拿着这个。
[咕哝]

06:46.500 --> 06:47.833
[squeals]
[gasps]
[尖叫声]
[喘气]

06:47.833 --> 06:50.767
You're not small like me,
shorty.
你并不像我那么小
矮个子。

06:50.767 --> 06:55.500
I am a towering half
a millimeter taller than you.
我是高耸的一半
比你高一毫米。

06:55.500 --> 06:58.833
I win!
[laughing]
我赢了！
[笑]

06:58.833 --> 07:00.733
- Hooray!
- [groaning]
- 万岁！
- [呻吟]

07:00.733 --> 07:02.067
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:02.067 --> 07:03.800
- I'll get that.
- Don't touch that!
- 我会明白的。
- 别碰那个！

07:03.800 --> 07:06.067
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:06.067 --> 07:07.400
- Oops.
- 哎呀。

07:08.900 --> 07:11.433
- Get him out of here,
Karen!
- 带他离开这里
凯伦！

07:11.433 --> 07:13.367
- Way ahead of you, chief.
- 远远领先于你，酋长。

07:13.367 --> 07:17.233
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

07:17.233 --> 07:18.567
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:20.200 --> 07:23.133
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:25.100 --> 07:26.467
- Cool.
- 凉爽的。

07:28.600 --> 07:29.933
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

07:31.567 --> 07:34.967
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

07:34.967 --> 07:38.367
[spits] Ha ha!
I found an action figure.
[吐口水]哈哈！
我找到了一个可动人偶。

07:38.367 --> 07:40.867
- Whoa.
I saw it first.
- 哇哦。
我先看到的。

07:40.867 --> 07:43.067
- No, I did.
- Finders keepers.
- 不，我做到了。
- 发现者和守门员。

07:43.067 --> 07:44.667
- Whoa!
- 哇！

07:44.667 --> 07:46.400
- What's the matter with you?
- 你怎么了？

07:47.267 --> 07:48.267
- Blech.
- 布莱赫。

07:48.267 --> 07:49.767
- It's got my spit on it.
-上面有我的口水。

07:49.767 --> 07:52.333
- Whoa!
You can't catch me.
- 哇！
你抓不到我。

07:52.333 --> 07:55.900
[laughing]
[笑]

07:55.900 --> 07:58.133
[kids shouting]
- Don't let him get away.
[孩子们喊叫]
- 别让他跑了。

08:00.067 --> 08:03.700
[all murmuring]
[大家窃窃私语]

08:03.700 --> 08:05.667
- [laughing]
- [grunts]
- [笑]
- [咕哝]

08:05.667 --> 08:08.400
This is the best
action figure ever.
这是最好的
有史以来的动作人物。

08:08.400 --> 08:10.300
- [panting]
- [snoring]
- [气喘吁吁]
- [打鼾]

08:10.300 --> 08:13.200
- SpongeBob
in the corner pocket. Doink!
- 海绵宝宝
在角落的口袋里。多因克！

08:14.267 --> 08:16.800
[all grunting, yelling]
[所有人咕哝，大喊]

08:16.800 --> 08:18.867
- You brats get back
in the play area
- 你们这群臭小子快回来吧
在游乐区

08:18.867 --> 08:21.067
or I'll 86 your face!
不然我就86你的脸！

08:21.067 --> 08:22.700
- [blows raspberry]
- [吹覆盆子]

08:22.700 --> 08:24.400
Bang, bang, bang, bang,
bang, bang, bang.
砰，砰，砰，砰，
砰，砰，砰。

08:24.400 --> 08:25.900
[laughing]
[笑]

08:25.900 --> 08:27.100
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

08:27.100 --> 08:30.100
all:
We want our action figure back.
全部：
我们希望我们的人偶回来。

08:31.167 --> 08:32.567
- Ow!
- 噢！

08:32.567 --> 08:34.067
- [laughing]
- [笑]

08:34.067 --> 08:36.733
- Krusty Krab action figures
aren't free, you know.
- 蟹堡王可动人偶
不是免费的，你知道。

08:36.733 --> 08:39.933
So get your parents' money
and you can have it.
所以要拿父母的钱
你可以拥有它。

08:43.067 --> 08:45.100
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

08:45.100 --> 08:49.067
- Uh, Eugene, we don't sell
action figures.
- 呃，尤金，我们不卖
动作人物。

08:49.933 --> 08:51.900
- Hmm.
- Peek-a-boo!
- 唔。
- 躲猫猫！

08:51.900 --> 08:53.467
- [gasps]
- What the--[moans]
- [喘气]
- 什么--[呻吟]

08:53.467 --> 08:55.967
- SpongeBob,
what are you doing in my hand?
- 海绵宝宝，
你在我手里做什么？

08:55.967 --> 08:58.733
And why aren't you back there
flipping patties?
你为什么不回来
翻转肉饼？

08:58.733 --> 09:01.267
- Sorry, Mr. K,
I shrunk myself by mistake,
- 对不起，K先生，
我不小心把自己缩小了

09:01.267 --> 09:02.933
but I won't let it
affect my job.
但我不会让它
影响我的工作。

09:02.933 --> 09:05.067
I will get back to flipping
right now.
我会重新开始翻转
现在。

09:06.067 --> 09:08.067
Hold on there, tiny.
坚持住，小小。

09:08.067 --> 09:10.567
I can't have you working
the grill no more.
我不能让你工作
不再是烤架了。

09:10.567 --> 09:12.467
Too dangerous for a little guy
like you.
对于一个小家伙来说太危险了
像你一样。

09:12.467 --> 09:15.267
- Oh, please, Mr. Krabs, there
must be some job I could do.
- 哦，请，蟹老板先生，在那儿
一定是我能做的一些工作。

09:15.267 --> 09:18.633
I don't care what it is.
Please, please, please?
我不在乎它是什么。
拜托，拜托，拜托？

09:18.633 --> 09:21.067
- All right,
I'll think of something.
- 好吧，
我会想点办法。

09:21.067 --> 09:23.167
But since you're so small now,
但既然你现在还这么小，

09:23.167 --> 09:26.067
I can only pay you
a penny...a year.
我只能付钱给你
一分钱……一年。

09:26.067 --> 09:27.400
- Whoa!
- 哇！

09:27.400 --> 09:29.167
That's big money.
那是一大笔钱。

09:29.167 --> 09:30.600
Ow!
- Hmm.
噢！
- 唔。

09:30.600 --> 09:34.567
Now, what could I do
with a little SpongeBob?
现在，我能做什么
和一个小海绵宝宝？

09:37.100 --> 09:39.233
Oh, hmm.
[grumbles]
哦，嗯。
[抱怨]

09:41.767 --> 09:44.367
- Personal hygiene service?
- 个人卫生服务？

09:44.367 --> 09:46.600
[all talking at once]
[大家同时说话]

09:46.600 --> 09:49.367
- Roll up your sleeves,
boy-o.
- 卷起袖子，
男孩-o。

09:49.367 --> 09:52.167
You're a personal hygienist now.
您现在是一名个人卫生员。

09:52.167 --> 09:53.967
- Whoo-hoo! Yay!
- 呼呼！耶！

09:56.367 --> 09:59.467
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

09:59.467 --> 10:01.067
- Ahh!
- 啊！

10:02.133 --> 10:04.300
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:04.300 --> 10:05.833
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

10:05.833 --> 10:08.667
- Right there, yeah.
- 就在那里，是的。

10:09.533 --> 10:13.167
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

10:13.167 --> 10:15.100
- Ahh.
- 啊。

10:16.167 --> 10:18.000
[toilet flushes]
[厕所冲水]

10:18.000 --> 10:20.233
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:20.233 --> 10:21.233
Whew.
呼。

10:21.233 --> 10:22.867
- Break time, SpongeBob.
- 休息时间，海绵宝宝。

10:22.867 --> 10:24.667
Take five,
but hurry back.
拿五个，
但快点回来。

10:24.667 --> 10:27.067
You gotta start earning
that penny.
你必须开始赚钱
那一分钱。

10:27.067 --> 10:30.733
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

10:32.067 --> 10:34.767
- Hmm. Work the register,
clean the windows,
- 唔。工作登记册，
清洁窗户，

10:34.767 --> 10:35.933
make the patties.
做肉饼。

10:35.933 --> 10:37.633
I have to do everything now.
我现在必须做所有事情。

10:37.633 --> 10:40.600
Thanks a lot, "ShrinkBob."
非常感谢，“收缩鲍勃”。

10:40.600 --> 10:43.433
[screaming, grunting]
[尖叫，咕哝]

10:43.433 --> 10:46.267
- It's okay, Squidward.
I'll make the patties for y--
- 没关系，章鱼哥。
我会为你做馅饼--

10:46.267 --> 10:48.100
Oh, yeah, I forgot.
哦，是的，我忘了。

10:48.100 --> 10:50.033
I'm too little.
我还太小了

10:52.200 --> 10:54.233
Boy, I'm really going to miss
my old job.
男孩，我真的会想念
我的旧工作。

10:54.233 --> 10:56.300
- Lunch rush is over,
Mr. Squidward.
- 午餐高峰结束了，
章鱼哥先生。

10:56.300 --> 10:59.167
Now, wash those dishes!
- [growling]
现在，洗那些盘子！
- [咆哮]

10:59.167 --> 11:01.433
- "Lunch rush is over,
Mr. Squidward.
- “午餐高峰结束了，
章鱼哥先生。

11:01.433 --> 11:02.833
Now, wash them dishes."
现在，给他们洗碗。”

11:02.833 --> 11:06.700
- [muffled yelling]
- [低声喊叫]

11:06.700 --> 11:09.167
The bubbles are
making me bigger.
气泡是
让我变得更大。

11:09.167 --> 11:10.900
More bubbles!
更多气泡！

11:10.900 --> 11:12.567
- What the?
[grunts]
- 什么？
[咕哝]

11:12.567 --> 11:13.933
- Thank you, Squidward.
- 谢谢你，章鱼哥。

11:13.933 --> 11:16.733
I'm big enough
to flip patties again.
我够大了
再次翻转肉饼。

11:16.733 --> 11:19.233
[shouting]
[喊叫]

11:19.233 --> 11:22.900
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

11:22.900 --> 11:25.667
- Whoa!
- [screaming]
- 哇！
- [尖叫]

11:27.100 --> 11:29.367
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

11:29.367 --> 11:32.967
- Mr. Squidward!
Call the fire department!
- 章鱼哥先生！
打电话叫消防队！

11:32.967 --> 11:35.067
- No need to call them,
Mr. Krabs.
- 无需打电话给他们，
蟹老板。

11:35.067 --> 11:36.667
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

11:36.667 --> 11:39.200
We'll be there in five minutes
depending on traffic.
我们五分钟后到
取决于交通情况。

11:39.200 --> 11:41.867
[laughing]
- Make a left at the light!
[笑]
- 在红绿灯处左转！

[笑]
- 在红绿灯处左转！